  "notes": "{詐欺|さぎ} refers to fraud or swindling.\n\nTYPES:\n- ⟦{振|ふ}り{込|こ}め→振り込む：10992_furikomu⟧{詐欺|さぎ}: bank transfer fraud (phone scam)\n- ⟦{投資|とうし}→投資：04711_toushi⟧{詐欺|さぎ}: investment fraud\n- ⟦{結婚|けっこん}→結婚：02514_kekkon⟧{詐欺|さぎ}: marriage fraud\n- ⟦{保険|ほけん}→保険：01509_hoken⟧{詐欺|さぎ}: insurance fraud\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {詐欺|さぎ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{遭|あ}う→遭う：09500_au⟧ (to fall victim to fraud)\n- {詐欺|さぎ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{働|はたら}く→働く：00503_hataraku⟧ (to commit fraud)\n- {詐欺|さぎ}{師|し} (con artist, swindler)\n- {詐欺|さぎ}{罪|ざい} (fraud charge)\n\nNOTE: Do not confuse with ⟦{鷺|さぎ}→鷺：04939_sagi⟧ (heron), which has the same reading.",
